ilke som helst blokker oppå.','Forms of Contact Form 7, WPForms, Fluent Forms and other form plugins in the look of your store.'=>'Skjemaer fra Contact Form 7, WPForms, Fluent Forms og andre skjematillegg i butikkens stil.','The languages of WPML, Polylang or TranslatePress in your header or footer.'=>'Språkene fra WPML, Polylang eller TranslatePress i toppteksten eller bunnteksten.','New templates without updates'=>'Nye maler uten oppdateringer','Templates Import loads new free templates from our library as soon as they are published.'=>'Malimport henter nye gratis maler fra biblioteket vårt så snart de er publisert.','Classic themes: templates and store layouts keep their width, and small block images stay small in Twenty Twenty-One.'=>'Klassiske temaer: maler og butikkoppsett beholder bredden sin, og små blokkbilder forblir små i Twenty Twenty-One.','Welcome'=>'Velkommen','Blocks'=>'Blokker','Guides'=>'Guider','Settings'=>'Innstillinger','Envo Blocks PRO'=>'Envo Blocks PRO','Get PRO'=>'Skaff PRO','Sales'=>'Salg','More'=>'Mer','Block settings'=>'Blokkinnstillinger','Discount Rules'=>'Rabattregler','Abandoned Carts'=>'Forlatte handlekurver','Loyalty Points'=>'Lojalitetspoeng','There are no settings yet.'=>'Det finnes ingen innstillinger ennå.','Envo Blocks Settings'=>'Envo Blocks-innstillinger','WooCommerce is needed'=>'WooCommerce kreves','WooCommerce is installed but not active'=>'WooCommerce er installert, men ikke aktivt','WooCommerce is not installed'=>'WooCommerce er ikke installert','Checkout Fields, Payment QR Code, Invoices, Store Layouts and the blocks marked WooCommerce need an active WooCommerce. They appear in the Envo Blocks menu and in the block inserter as soon as it is active. The templates, sections, presets and the other blocks work without it.'=>'Kassefelt, Payment QR Code, Fakturaer, Butikkoppsett og blokkene merket WooCommerce krever et aktivt WooCommerce. De vises i menyen Envo Blocks og i blokkinnsetteren så snart det er aktivt. Malene, seks